<title>USA: Toyota June US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Toyota June US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Jun 1-30, 1997     Jun 1-30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    50,675	    48,433	     +4.6</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  10,561	    12,180	    -13.3</p>
<p> Import Car		14,782	    18,424	    -19.8</p>
<p> Import Truck	    20,022	    19,278	     +3.9</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Jun 30, 1997 Jan 1-Jun 30, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	   326,475	   283,926	    +15.7</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  69,316	    70,778	     -1.4</p>
<p> Import Car	     108,308	   114,764	     -5.0</p>
<p> Import Truck	   125,139	   107,636	    +17.0</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 25 in latest month vs 25, 153 for year to date vs 154 in year ago.</p>
</text>
